speechtext:
In this case it is not
a question of management at all. Here is an illustration of the truth of the old adage: A little learning is a dangerous thing;
Drink deep, or taste not the Pierian spring.

I may be wrong; I want information;
but I have been informed that fine paper was being sold in Canada for, I think_ seven cents per pound, and the same paper was being sold to American users of that class of paper for five cents per pound, irrespective of the sales tax altogether. I may be wrong in that information. I have no hesitation in giving names, and the firm that I refer to was the Howard .Smith Paper Company.
There was no mention there of bonds or anything like it.
